    "Generating sends %@ to “%@” (%@). Audio, structured profile email fields, and attachments are not added to the model input. Email addresses written into the meeting text or the notes are included with it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Beim Erstellen werden %1$@ an „%2$@“ (%3$@) gesendet. Audio, strukturierte E-Mail-Felder in Profilen und Anhänge werden dem Modelleingang nicht hinzugefügt. E-Mail-Adressen im Meetingtext oder in den Notizen werden mitgesendet."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "Generating sends %1$@ to “%2$@” (%3$@). Audio, structured profile email fields, and attachments are not added to the model input. Email addresses written into the meeting text or the notes are included with it."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "產生報告時會將 %1$@ 傳送至「%2$@」（%3$@）。音訊、結構化個人資料電子郵件欄位與附件不會加入模型輸入。寫在會議文字或筆記中的電子郵件地址將包含在內。"
